    <p>An example article for testing metadata encoding in various formats. It illustrates Stencila&apos;s focus on the <ext-link xlink:href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robustness_principle">Robustness Principle</ext-link>: <inline-quote>be conservative in what you do, be liberal in what you accept from others</inline-quote>. Metadata can be added to YAML front-matter in Markdown documents in a variety of ways, and it is parsed into Stencila Schema nodes.</p>
